<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin signs peace accord with Chechen leader.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin signs peace accord with Chechen leader.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Boris Yeltsin and Chechen leader Aslan Maskhadov signed a peace accord on Monday defining relations between Russia and its breakaway north Caucasus region, Russian news agencies said.</p>
</text>
